WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.729 --> 00:00:08.480
Fox News Propaganda's Tucker Carlson was instantly
destroyed on live TV after parroting the falsehood

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:13.549
that young children don't spread Corona virus,
which is a very dangerous and irresponsible

00:00:13.549 --> 00:00:14.749
thing to say.

00:00:14.749 --> 00:00:18.200
Tucker Carlson interviewed Fox News Dr. Marc
SIEGEL.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:23.380
Marc SIEGEL has certainly had some cringeworthy
moments on Fox News over the years.

00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:25.019
But credit to Marc SIEGEL.

00:00:25.019 --> 00:00:30.300
He called out Trump for the bleach injection
fiasco and he instantly calls out Tucker Carlson

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:33.420
for this wild claim about kids and corona
virus.

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:34.420
Check it out.

00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:35.420
Latest science.

00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:40.170
There is new evidence that young children
do not spread the corona virus.

00:00:40.170 --> 00:00:41.730
Not what we thought.

00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:45.420
Dr. Marc SIEGEL is a Fox Monitor contributor
at NYU Langone.

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:49.019
Professor, Doctor, thanks for coming on tonight.

00:00:49.019 --> 00:00:53.250
Tucker, I want to cut through the news and
get to the science of this, which is that

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:58.559
78 studies out of the United Kingdom show
that children, especially under the age of

00:00:58.559 --> 00:01:02.199
10, are not very likely to get covered 19
or to spread it.

00:01:02.199 --> 00:01:05.680
But one of the authors of that study says
he's being a little bit misinterpreted in

00:01:05.680 --> 00:01:10.940
the Centers for Disease Control has said that
1 to 2 percent of the cases looking at one

00:01:10.940 --> 00:01:14.430
hundred and fifty thousand cases were children
under the age of 18.

00:01:14.430 --> 00:01:16.110
That's the real truth.

00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:20.800
Here is and a China study showed that 90 percent
of children have asymptomatic cases.

00:01:20.800 --> 00:01:25.580
So, Tucker, they appear to have a protein
in the lungs that protects them from severe

00:01:25.580 --> 00:01:26.580
disease.

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:30.840
And almost all of the children who get this
are either asymptomatic or have mild cases.

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:33.030
But it is not true that children don't get
it.

00:01:33.030 --> 00:01:38.590
And it is not true that they can't spread
it just much less likely than adults.

00:01:38.590 --> 00:01:44.320
The look on Tucker's face, if you were watching
a look that says this is going horribly wrong,

00:01:44.320 --> 00:01:46.390
that's worth Tucker's weight in gold.

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.600
Young children do not spread coronavirus.

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:52.990
Marc SIEGEL immediately says actually children
do spread it.

00:01:52.990 --> 00:02:01.420
Tucker Carlson says this is the type of stuff
that when the disinformation spreads, it leads

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:02.420
to infections.

00:02:02.420 --> 00:02:04.540
People are just mixing up different claims.

00:02:04.540 --> 00:02:05.810
So let's look at them.

00:02:05.810 --> 00:02:10.069
Are children less likely to get a symptomatic
case of the virus?

00:02:10.069 --> 00:02:13.120
Yes, that's what the science currently says.

00:02:13.120 --> 00:02:18.959
When children do get it, is their chance of
dying from it lower than adults?

00:02:18.959 --> 00:02:19.959
Absolutely.

00:02:19.959 --> 00:02:21.700
What the science says right now.

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:25.769
But children can spread it even when they
have it without symptoms.

00:02:25.769 --> 00:02:31.230
This is one of the reasons that schools had
to be closed because one parent gets it.

00:02:31.230 --> 00:02:32.439
Then a kid has it.

00:02:32.439 --> 00:02:35.480
Then 10 kids have it and they bring it home
to their parents.

00:02:35.480 --> 00:02:37.749
What Tucker Carlson is saying is just not
true.

00:02:37.749 --> 00:02:40.329
There seems to be no corona virus.

00:02:40.329 --> 00:02:44.409
Rumor that someone on Fox News is not willing
to spread.

00:02:44.409 --> 00:02:51.349
Tucker was just complaining that shut downs
and stay at home orders were not decided with

00:02:51.349 --> 00:02:52.430
science.

00:02:52.430 --> 00:02:55.909
And then he casually says kids can't spread
the virus when, of course, they can.

00:02:55.909 --> 00:03:00.379
And it's particularly important to understand
that the most dangerous spreaders can be those

00:03:00.379 --> 00:03:04.769
without symptoms, because the kids have no
reason to think that they're sick and then

00:03:04.769 --> 00:03:06.770
they become vast spreaders.

00:03:06.770 --> 00:03:12.700
There was a study that finds actually that
kids zero to 6 have a very similar viral load

00:03:12.700 --> 00:03:19.270
as those 12 to 19 and may maybe spreading
the disease just as effectively as high schoolers.

00:03:19.270 --> 00:03:25.970
Now, what is certainly true is that if an
adult gets the virus and you contact trace,

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:28.240
there are probably fewer kids they've been
in touch with.

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:34.180
Unless you have kids or you work with children,
most of your contacts are going to be adults.

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:36.609
Maybe that's where something got mixed up.

00:03:36.609 --> 00:04:45.610
But good for Dr. SIEGEL to immediately call
out this nonsense from Tucker Carlson.

